            "heading": "Choosing the Right Piercing Jewelry for Your Style",
            "text": "<p>Piercing jewelry is more than just an accessory—it's a reflection of your personal style and comfort. Whether you prefer a minimalist stud, a statement hoop, or an elegant gemstone, the right jewelry enhances your piercing experience.<br>Selecting the best material, size, and design ensures long-term wearability while reducing the risk of irritation. This guide will help you navigate through the best options for your unique aesthetic and lifestyle.</p>"
          }
        },
        "body_2": {
          "type": "body_split",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/image_107.png",
            "image_position": "right",
            "image_width": 344,
            "heading": "Material Matters: Finding the Safest Option",
            "text": "<p>Not all piercing jewelry is created equal! Choosing high-quality materials is essential for safety, longevity, and comfort. Here's a breakdown of the best options:</p><ul><li>Titanium – Lightweight, hypoallergenic, and perfect for sensitive skin.</li><li>Surgical Stainless Steel – A durable and cost-effective choice for healed piercings.</li><li>Solid Gold (14K & Higher) – Elegant and safe, but best for fully healed piercings.</li><li>Bioplast & PTFE – Flexible and ideal for reducing irritation, commonly used in new piercings.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "body_3": {
          "type": "body_group",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<p>Choosing the right piercing jewelry is about more than just aesthetics—it's about comfort, safety, and self-expression. From sleek titanium hoops to elegant gold studs, selecting high-quality materials ensures better healing and long-term wear. Whether you're drawn to minimalist designs or bold statement pieces, the perfect jewelry enhances your look while keeping your piercing healthy and stylish.</p>"
          }
        },
        "body_4": {
          "type": "body_split",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Mask_group_44.png",
            "image_position": "left",
            "image_width": 472,
            "heading": "Factors to Consider When Choosing Jewelry:",
            "text": "<ul><li>Jewelry Type Matters: Hoops, studs, and barbells all serve different purposes—choose based on your piercing placement.</li><li>Find the Perfect Fit: The wrong size can cause irritation or migration—always consult a professional for measurements.</li><li>Match Your Style: Opt for minimalist designs for a subtle look or bold, gem-studded pieces for a statement.</li><li>Check for Hypoallergenic Materials: Nickel-free jewelry is a must for sensitive skin.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "body_5": {
          "type": "body_quote",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>\"Your jewelry is an extension of your personality—choose pieces that make you feel confident and comfortable.\"</p>"
          }
        },
        "body_6": {
          "type": "body_group",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<p>Your choice of piercing jewelry plays a huge role in both aesthetic appeal and healing process. Whether you're looking for a classic gold hoop, an edgy black titanium ring, or a delicate stud, selecting high-quality materials and the right size is key.</p>"
          }
